## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-08-02. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### EXP Pickoff Bruiser (EXP)

- Items: Tough Boots, Genius Wand, Concentrated Energy, Glowing Wand, Antique Cuirass, Immortality
- Core: Genius Wand, Concentrated Energy, Glowing Wand
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Rupture, Bargain Hunter, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Arcane Boots over Tough Boots when Use when the enemy EXP lane lacks early crowd control and the first cage needs more Magic Penetration than tenacity.; Athena's Shield over Antique Cuirass when Use against front-loaded magic burst that can remove Silvanna before Spiral Strangling finishes, when the counterturn is magic rather than physical.; Divine Glaive over Immortality when Use when the enemy front line stacks Magic Defense and your team still needs Silvanna to finish trapped targets.; Winter Crown over Immortality when Use when the enemy saves counterburst for after your ultimate lands and stasis can protect the full spin.
- Total cost: 11060 gold

Default EXP lane setup for ranked games where Silvanna needs one reliable catch, repeated Magic Defense shred, anti-sustain burn, and enough durability to survive the counterturn.

### EXP Sustain Duelist (EXP)

- Items: Magic Boots, Feather of Heaven, Concentrated Energy, Oracle, Queen's Wings, Blood Wings
- Core: Feather of Heaven, Concentrated Energy, Oracle
- Emblem: Fighter Emblem with Rupture, Festival of Blood, Brave Smite
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Tough Boots over Magic Boots when Use when control duration is the reason Silvanna cannot stay attached after Imperial Justice.; Dominance Ice over Queen's Wings when Use against lifesteal marksmen, sustain fighters, or sustain frontliners that need the Lifebane aura and Fortress Shield hybrid defense.; Radiant Armor over Blood Wings when Use against repeated magic hits where stacked Magic Defense is better than a regenerating Magic Power shield.; Immortality over Blood Wings when Use before late Lord fights when one failed cage would decide the game.
- Total cost: 10970 gold

Long-trade EXP setup for matchups where Feather of Heaven, ultimate attack speed, shield amplification, and low-HP damage reduction let Silvanna keep fighting after the first target survives.

### Jungle Tempo Cage (Jungle)

- Items: Arcane Boots, Genius Wand, Concentrated Energy, Glowing Wand, Holy Crystal, Immortality
- Core: Genius Wand, Concentrated Energy, Glowing Wand
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Rupture, Seasoned Hunter, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Ice Retribution
- Flex: Tough Boots over Arcane Boots when Use when early ganks fail because enemy crowd control stops the second skill channel.; Divine Glaive over Holy Crystal when Use when objectives become front-to-back fights against two or more Magic Defense items.; Winter Crown over Immortality when Use when Silvanna must dive past the front line and dodge the first collapse after the cage lands.; Blood Wings over Immortality when Use while ahead when the shield and movement speed help chain ganks without giving up too much damage.
- Total cost: 11880 gold

Jungle variant for drafts that need Silvanna to farm level-four tempo, add Ice Retribution chase control, and turn one objective fight into a trapped enemy core.

